  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "This recipe will make about 8 cups. Work in batches to best fit your blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel bananas, break into chunks, and add to blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, halve, and pit avocado; add to blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add almond butter, cocoa powder, almond milk, maple syrup, cinnamon, salt, and 8 ice cubes to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend on high speed for several minutes until smooth."
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the smoothie into glasses and enjoy!"
    }
